{"id": "DfPbvFhyi8Y", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Har train ke saath saal guzarte gaye… aur woh aaj bhi usi platform pe khada hai. Aakhir tak dekhna 🚉\n\nIsi platform se woh gayi thi, ek baarish waali raat. Tab se har train ek mausam le jaati hai: baarish, kohra, gulmohar… aur woh wahin khada rehta hai, do kulhad chai mangwa ke.\nEk raat ek dheemi train guzri, uski khidkiyon mein unki yaadein thi: pehli chai, ek peela chhata, uski hansi, woh alvida.\nAur aakhri train ke kaale sheeshe mein usne apna chehra dekha… baal safed ho chuke the. Muffler wahi tha.\n\n🎵 Choo Lo · The Local Train (Aalas Ka Pedh)\n@thelocaltrain \nUsko bhejo jo aaj bhi usi jagah intezaar kar raha hai 🚉\n\nChoo Lo | The Local Train | Aalas Ka Pedh | intezaar | railway platform | baarish ki raat | purani yaadein | lyrics reel\n\n#ChooLo #TheLocalTrain #Intezaar", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1793627185, "like_count": 777, "comment_count": 7, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1700943688031220a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.727, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPgAseCN7J46PU0lUtzjczcgnG_C1jtGda7FEPweOPNw1OJpdBQVcNDEmdB7Ijy3v7Mc7gPcomo8cLn2WTaU6OsHOO3i-3OnvAJBDE.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=AdomfX0NuAWYFmbCqCrgP7zo4HkQJJ5lk5cHvM8oPBapzsqmw6jpzzbWBgjmka2L3rlAhAhqT5OssPzRMtEUhg6x&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=yxSsaoAiCtkQ7kNvwH2rj6b&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=ikYj1XkQyPS8APG1qYrEWA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQS7QfAn2H5qiRRfba2jN1DKzxMo2_CgQ8QrHsKLS7tiJw&oe=6AF422FB", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 64.727, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": 